Constructor: add `this.selectedSlot = 1`, `this.rebinding=false`, maybe `this.actions`. Also init i18n at boot before checkSave. Since i18n module init not called yet. Add `initI18n()` in boot first line. Also onLangChange to refresh title.

Title bind: language switch buttons, slot clicks generated.

Replace checkSave function. Let's design:

```
checkSave() {
 migrateSaves()
 this.refreshTitleSaves()
 this.updateTitleLanguage()
}
updateTitleLanguage() {
 document.querySelectorAll('#title-lang button').forEach...
 const last=lastSlot(); const sum=slotSummary(last)
 const cont=$('btn-continue')
 if (!sum.empty) { cont.classList.remove('hidden'); cont.textContent = `${t('title.continue')} — ${sum.name} · ${t('hud.level')} ${sum.level}` }
 else cont.classList.add('hidden')
 $('title-seed-label').textContent = sum.empty ? t('title.seedReady') : `${t('title.savedWorld')} · ${sum.seed}`
}
refreshTitleSaves() {
 const wrap=$('title-slots'); if(!wrap)return
 const last=lastSlot()
 wrap.innerHTML = SAVE_SLOTS.map(slot=>{
   const s=slotSummary(slot)
   const selected = this.selectedSlot===slot
   if(s.empty) return `<div class="slot-row empty ${selected?'selected':''}" data-slot-select="${slot}">...<span>${t('title.empty')}</span><button data-slot-start="${slot}">${t('title.start')}</button></div>`
   return `<div class="slot-row ${selected?'selected':''}" data-slot-select="${slot}">...<b>${s.name}</b> <span>Nv ${s.level} · ${s.badges} badges · ${s.caught} capturés</span><div actions><button data-slot-play>${t('title.play')}</button><button data-slot-start>${t('title.overwrite')}</button><button data-slot-del>✕</button></div></div>`
 }).join('')
 // handlers
 ...
}
```
Need escape HTML names. Add helper `esc`.

Clicking row select updates selectedSlot and refresh. Start button:
- if empty: startNewGame(slot) reading name/colors from title.
- if occupied: confirm(t('save.overwrite')) then startNewGame(slot).
- play: continueGame(slot).
- delete: confirm then deleteSlot; if lastSlot deleted maybe set other; refresh.

New Journey button: uses selectedSlot (default first empty or 1). If selected occupied, confirm overwrite. Also if name empty, random name.
